#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.rst:2
msgid "nanstd"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:1
msgid "Compute the standard deviation of a tensor, ignoring NaN values."
msgstr "NaN 値を無視して、テンソルの標準偏差を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:3
msgid ""
"This function calculates the standard deviation of tensor elements along "
"the specified dimension(s) while excluding NaN values, as the square root"
" of :func:`nanvar`.  The standard deviation can be computed using either "
"the unbiased estimator (dividing by ``N-1``) or the biased estimator "
"(dividing by ``N``), where ``N`` is the number of non-NaN elements."
msgstr "この関数は、指定された次元に沿ってテンソル要素の標準偏差を、:func:`nanvar` の平方根として計算します。計算時には NaN 値は除外されます。標準偏差は、不偏推定量（``N-1`` で除算）または偏推定量（``N`` で除算）のいずれかを用いて計算できます。ここで ``N`` は NaN 値を除いた要素数です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:10
msgid "The NaN-aware standard deviation is computed as:"
msgstr "NaN を考慮した標準偏差は以下のように計算されます："

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:12
msgid ""
"\\text{nanstd}(X) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{N_{\\text{valid}} - \\delta}\n"
"    \\sum_{i \\text{ valid}} (X_i - \\bar{X})^2}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{nanstd}(X) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{N_{\\text{valid}} - \\delta}\n"
"    \\sum_{i \\text{ valid}} (X_i - \\bar{X})^2}\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:16
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\bar{X}` is the mean of valid (non-NaN) values, "
":math:`N_{\\text{valid}}` is the number of valid values, and "
":math:`\\delta` is 1 if :attr:`unbiased` is ``True`` and 0 otherwise."
msgstr "ここで、:math:`\\bar{X}` は有効な値（NaN でない値）の平均、:math:`N_{\\text{valid}}` は有効な値の個数であり、:math:`\\delta` は :attr:`unbiased` が ``True`` の場合は 1、そうでない場合は 0 です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:21
msgid "The input tensor."
msgstr "入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:24
msgid ""
"The dimension(s) along which to compute the standard deviation. If None "
"(default), the standard deviation is computed over all elements. Can be a"
" single dimension or multiple dimensions."
msgstr "標準偏差を計算する次元を指定します。None（デフォルト）の場合は、すべての要素に対して標準偏差を計算します。単一の次元または複数の次元を指定できます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:30
msgid ""
"If ``True`` (default), uses Bessel's correction and divides by ``N-1`` "
"where ``N`` is the number of non-NaN elements. If ``False``, divides by "
"``N``."
msgstr "デフォルト値の ``True`` の場合、ベッセル補正を適用し、非 NaN 要素の数を ``N`` として ``N-1`` で除算します。``False`` の場合、``N`` で除算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:35
msgid ""
"If ``True``, the output tensor has the same number of dimensions as the "
"input, with the reduced dimensions having size 1. If ``False`` (default),"
" the reduced dimensions are removed."
msgstr "``True`` の場合、出力テンソルは入力テンソルと同じ数の次元を持ち、削減された次元のサイズは 1 になります。``False`` の場合（デフォルト）、削減された次元は削除されます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:41
msgid ""
"The standard deviation of non-NaN elements. The shape depends on the "
":attr:`dim` and :attr:`keepdim` parameters."
msgstr "非 NaN 要素の標準偏差。形状は :attr:`dim` と :attr:`keepdim` パラメータに依存します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:46
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:48
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, nan, 4.0, 5.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanstd(x)\n"
"tensor(1.8257)"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, nan, 4.0, 5.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanstd(x)\n"
"tensor(1.8257)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:52
msgid ""
">>> # With biased estimator\n"
">>> QF.nanstd(x, unbiased=False)\n"
"tensor(1.5811)"
msgstr ""
">>> # 偏りのある推定量を使用\n"
">>> QF.nanstd(x, unbiased=False)\n"
"tensor(1.5811)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:56
msgid ""
">>> # 2D tensor with dimension specification\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0, nan],\n"
"...                   [4.0, nan, 6.0]])\n"
">>> QF.nanstd(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([0.7071, 1.4142])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 次元を指定した 2 次元テンソル\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0, nan],\n"
"...                   [4.0, nan, 6.0]])\n"
">>> QF.nanstd(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([0.7071, 1.4142])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:62
msgid ""
">>> # Keep dimensions\n"
">>> QF.nanstd(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[0.7071],\n"
"        [1.4142]])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 次元を保持\n"
">>> QF.nanstd(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[0.7071],\n"
"        [1.4142]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:67
msgid ""
"With :attr:`unbiased` set to ``True``, slices with fewer than two valid "
"values yield NaN because Bessel's correction divides by ``N-1``. With "
":attr:`unbiased` set to ``False``, a slice with a single valid value "
"yields 0, and only all-NaN slices yield NaN."
msgstr ":attr:`unbiased` が ``True`` の場合、ベッセル補正では ``N-1`` で除算するため、有効な値が 2 個未満のスライスは NaN になります。:attr:`unbiased` が ``False`` の場合、有効な値が 1 個だけのスライスは 0 になり、すべてが NaN のスライスのみが NaN になります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:73
msgid ":func:`nanvar`: NaN-aware variance function."
msgstr ":func:`nanvar`: NaN を考慮した分散関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:74
msgid ":func:`nanmean`: NaN-aware mean function."
msgstr ":func:`nanmean`: NaN を考慮した平均関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:75
msgid ":func:`mstd`: Moving standard deviation function."
msgstr ":func:`mstd`: 移動標準偏差関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanstd.nanstd:76
msgid "``torch.std``: Standard deviation function (NaN propagates)."
msgstr "``torch.std``: 標準偏差関数（NaN は伝播します）。"

